{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-04",
  "title": "潰爛的瘡疤",
  "storyCode": "6-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ba799282ec72f4bc625b37f76fc16f34cc666da5a01ee3519e84daf25a490665",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_uptown_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快！快撤！那些感染者已經變成徹底的怪物了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！！我被咬住了，我被咬住了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（恐怖的尖叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎麼會這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混帳白髮小子！！他又幹了什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，動作快！我們快去預定地點和阿米婭會合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個數量級的牧群，不成型的火力小隊是對付不了的，我們只能酌情行事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這時候可別想著幫助近衛局作戰，我們的處境可比他們窘迫多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先暫緩對近衛局的援助，我現在只敢保證你我的安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcity_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，這波我們實在扛不住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "必須撤離！再不撤的話，我們小隊就完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別慌張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？！你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這身裝束......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_041",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "援軍馬上就到了。再堅持一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_041",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分成兩隊吧。向他們兩側移動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，大人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_041",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次請相信我。雖然我不能出手，但這個辦法會起效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_041",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夾擊之後，從兩側把他們控制住；剩下的，就交給援軍吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，呃！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝長官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你沒幫我們擋下那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "背後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，快回擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們聚攏。縮起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，可是那樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。在這裡，光防禦並沒有用。我們必須得主動尋找出路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，從高處！我們從樓梯走，反過來利用建築裡的走廊攻擊它們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不行，好像還是只能防禦。但至少不會再被這一大群瘋子擠在角落了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，先轉移，然後通過各出入口聚攏，快速收縮隊伍，進入防禦姿態！快，動起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好。加分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官，請跟我們一起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_040",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從地上走過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcity_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攻勢太猛烈了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們裝備的都是穿刺性武器，沒法有效對抗他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能退後！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們背後是安全區！要是讓他們打進去了，裡面的市民就完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那怎麼辦？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要戰便戰！戰到近衛局一個都不剩為止！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心源石投擲物，除了會腐蝕裝備以外，有些是會爆炸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......！阿中受傷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿中，退下來！你，頂上去！別讓它們穿過防線！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊！它，它抓到我了，它在咬，不，唉啊啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿義！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真丟人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "縱貫白雷正法，去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，唔！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雷電法術？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什，什麼......一瞬間就把這些躁狂患者都消滅了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才就說了不會出手不會出手，沒想到，你們這個樣子怎麼保護百姓？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到最後居然還是讓我動手了，太丟臉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "監察司長官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官前長官後的，不是讓你們當我不存在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們沒想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來想說精神可嘉，結果你們現在都活蹦亂跳的，還把事情丟給我解決，也不知道你們還能幹些什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走！去下個地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是你剛才說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快指路！我都動手了，你們怎麼就不知道動作快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，剛剛我沒出手過，一定給我記住了，明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但百姓要是受到一分一毫的傷害，你們都該撤職，我也得辭職，全部失業！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明，明白......我們會盡力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道就好！還站在那幹嘛？走呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......對了，你們認識那些黑蓑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑蓑？那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼力太差了吧！就是那些在樓頂上行動的，穿黑色蓑衣的人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊長",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉長官，你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcity_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盾衛出列！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偵察隊，後撤！死守火力點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些突變感染者，居然還會擾亂電波？這樣下去，偵察隊也會有危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒法停下來！止不住！你剛才一個人砍了多少這種東西？能不能再表演一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？個仆街龍關鍵時刻怎麼這麼沒用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你先表演點作用給我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無人機！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳警司說了！！！偵察隊！！！後撤！！！死守火力點！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我問你怎麼樣！火力小組，弩彈發射！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把我弄耳鳴了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去，用你這本領通知帶β號源石電台的通訊小組，讓他通知其他各大隊，牧群棘手，堅守位置，儘量減少傷亡，別省火力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可真是個*不雅用語*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到你的嘴型了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "char_308_swire",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（“丟”音的嘴型）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳sir！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽不清！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳sir！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（此起彼伏的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聲音再大點！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳sir！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用破牆彈！快！破牆彈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真安靜啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陳sir。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我聽得見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說。沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們有......客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經來了嗎？看來已經順勢混進我們的小隊裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也算是意料之中。他們不可能真放手讓近衛局去做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無所謂，不用改變任何計畫。讓他們看看龍門的實力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一個消息，我......不知道它的準確性怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有隊員目擊到身穿黑色雨披的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恰好相反，我們發現的都是整合運動與他們交戰的痕跡。而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......那些整合運動的死狀都很......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞什麼都市傳說，大晴天的穿著黑色雨披在龍門裡神出鬼沒？真該去看精神科了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑色雨披？"
